~ start
do SignalManager.cutscene_started.emit()
Amelia: There it is! The key to the attic!
Theodore: A-bear-antly. Wait, it's up there? How are we going to get it?
Amelia: If we can just shake the cabinet a bit . . .
Theodore: [wave amp=10 freq=4]With my bear arms![/wave]
Theodore: [wave amp=15 freq=5]~Oomph~[/wave]
do SignalManager.got_key.emit()
Amelia: I got it! Thanks Teddy, I can always count on you.
do SignalManager.cutscene_ended.emit()
do SignalManager.dialogue_ended.emit()
=> END
